ckerDropdown composes the popover version for you. Months slide and fade as you page, the header opens direct month and year choices, and dates are plain YYYY-MM-DD strings, so they do not shift with the browser's timezone. It is built with Framer Motion and styled with Tailwind CSS.\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-6 font-medium text-foreground\",\"children\":\"When to use it\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"A hotel, rental or travel booking flow needs check-in and check-out dates.\",{\"children\":\"A hotel, rental or travel booking flow needs check-in and check-out dates.\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"An analytics dashboard filters charts and reports by a date range, with presets like the last 7 or 30 days.\",{\"children\":\"An analytics dashboard filters charts and reports by a date range, with presets like the last 7 or 30 days.\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"A leave request, invoice or report form needs a bounded range with blocked dates.\",{\"children\":\"A leave request, invoice or report form needs a bounded range with blocked dates.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-6 font-medium text-foreground\",\"children\":\"Accessibility\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2\",\"children\":\"The month is a grid of date buttons with a single tab stop, and the visible month is announced in a polite live heading. Arrow keys move between dates, Home and End move within the week, Page Up and Page Down change the month, and Shift with Page Up or Page Down changes the year, while Enter or Space selects a date; in the month and year choices, arrow keys move and Escape returns. Hidden help text describes these keys, and selection changes are announced through a status region. When the dropdown opens, focus moves to the active date. With reduced motion enabled, month changes fade without sliding and press scaling is removed.\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-6 font-medium text-foreground\",\"c